<column caption="Gross Sales" datatype="real" default-format='c"$"#,##0;-"$"#,##0' name="[Calculation_4417001]" role='measure' type='quantitative'>
  <calculation class='tableau' formula="SUM([face_value]) + SUM([service_fee]) + SUM([facility_fee]) + SUM([demand_fee]) + SUM([order_fees_allocated])" />
  <desc><formatted-text><run>Everything fans paid for primary tickets at the time of purchase: face value plus every fee, order fees shared across the tickets in the order. Before refunds. Chargebacks, resale and test events are left out.</run></formatted-text></desc>
</column>
<column caption="Total Fees" datatype="real" default-format='c"$"#,##0;-"$"#,##0' name="[Calculation_4417002]" role='measure' type='quantitative'>
  <calculation class='tableau' formula="SUM([service_fee]) + SUM([facility_fee]) + SUM([demand_fee]) + SUM([order_fees_allocated])" />
  <desc><formatted-text><run>Every fee on primary tickets, the venue's facility fee included.</run></formatted-text></desc>
</column>
<column caption="Fee Take Rate" datatype="real" default-format="p0.0%" name="[Calculation_4417003]" role='measure' type='quantitative'>
  <calculation class='tableau' formula="(SUM([service_fee]) + SUM([facility_fee]) + SUM([demand_fee]) + SUM([order_fees_allocated])) / SUM([face_value])" />
  <desc><formatted-text><run>All fees divided by face value: the take rate finance reports to venues and promoters. Guest-list comps have no face value and no fees, so they do not move it.</run></formatted-text></desc>
</column>
<column caption="Avg Ticket Price" datatype="real" default-format='c"$"#,##0.00' name="[Calculation_4417004]" role='measure' type='quantitative'>
  <calculation class='tableau' formula="SUM(IIF([is_comp] = 0, [face_value], 0)) / SUM(IIF([is_comp] = 0, 1, 0))" />
  <desc><formatted-text><run>Average face value of a paid ticket. Guest-list comps are left out.</run></formatted-text></desc>
</column>
<column caption="Tickets per Order" datatype="real" default-format="n#,##0.0" name="[Calculation_4417005]" role='measure' type='quantitative'>
  <calculation class='tableau' formula="AVG({FIXED [order_id] : COUNT([ticket_id])})" />
  <desc><formatted-text><run>Tickets in an order, averaged over orders.</run></formatted-text></desc>
</column>
<layout dim-ordering='alphabetic' measure-ordering='alphabetic' show-structure='true' />
